    "Bluesky apps that sign in with your account here, without an app password. Signing one out stops it at once." : "Hemen zure kontuarekin saioa hasten duten Bluesky aplikazioak, aplikazio-pasahitzik gabe. Baten saioa amaitzeak berehala geldiarazten du.",
    "No app has signed in this way." : "Ez du aplikaziorik saioa hasi modu honetan.",
