    "Could not delete your account" : "Ezin izan da zure kontua ezabatu",
    "Everything you posted from here is deleted, your followers and the people you follow are let go, and every server that knew this account is told it is gone. It cannot be undone, and there is no way to get any of it back afterwards — take an archive from the Export button above first if you might want one." : "Hemendik argitaratu duzun guztia ezabatzen da, zure jarraitzaileak eta zuk jarraitzen dituzunak askatzen dira, eta kontu hau ezagutzen zuen zerbitzari orori jakinarazten zaio desagertu dela. Ezin da desegin, eta ez dago ezer berreskuratzeko modurik ondoren — atera artxibo bat goiko Esportatu botoiarekin lehenik, nahi izan dezakezula uste baduzu.",
    "Your account on this server was made for Aloha Social, so it is deleted too, and you are signed out. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go." : "Zerbitzari honetako zure kontua Aloha Social-erako sortu zen, beraz hura ere ezabatzen da, eta saioa amaitzen zaizu. Ezabatzen ari zaren heldulekua ordubetez gordetzen da, inork ezin har dezan askatzen duzun unean bertan.",
    "Your Nextcloud account is not touched: you stay signed in to everything else, and you can make a new Aloha Social account straight away. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go, so a new account needs a different one." : "Zure Nextcloud kontua ez da ukitzen: gainerako guztian saioa hasita jarraitzen duzu, eta Aloha Social kontu berri bat berehala sor dezakezu. Ezabatzen ari zaren heldulekua ordubetez gordetzen da, inork ezin har dezan askatzen duzun unean bertan, beraz kontu berri batek beste bat behar du.",
    "A post that already reached somebody else's server is deleted by asking that server to delete it. Almost all of them do; none of them can be made to." : "Beste norbaiten zerbitzarira iritsi den mezu bat zerbitzari horri ezabatzeko eskatuz ezabatzen da. Ia denek egiten dute; inor ezin da behartu.",
    "Delete my Aloha Social account" : "Ezabatu nire Aloha Social kontua",
