    "Who may quote it" : "Nork aipa dezakeen",
    "This decides what happens from now on. It does not take back a quote somebody has already posted — use the list below for that." : "Honek hemendik aurrera gertatzen dena erabakitzen du. Ez du atzera botatzen norbaitek dagoeneko argitaratu duen aipurik — erabili beheko zerrenda horretarako.",
