    "Nobody has quoted this post." : "Inork ez du mezu hau aipatu.",
    "Detach this quote" : "Askatu aipu hau",
    "Detaching tells the other server, which then shows the quote as withdrawn. The post itself is theirs and stays where it is." : "Askatzeak beste zerbitzariari esaten dio, eta hark aipua erretiratu gisa erakusten du. Mezua bera haiena da eta dagoen lekuan geratzen da.",
    "This quote is waiting for the quoted author to approve it." : "Aipu hau aipatutako egileak onartzeko zain dago.",
    "The author of the quoted post did not allow this quote." : "Aipatutako mezuaren egileak ez du aipu hau baimendu.",
    "The author of the quoted post withdrew their permission for this quote." : "Aipatutako mezuaren egileak aipu honetarako baimena erretiratu du.",
    "The quoted post is not available." : "Aipatutako mezua ez dago eskuragarri.",
    "The quoted post quotes another post." : "Aipatutako mezuak beste mezu bat aipatzen du.",
    "Open the quoted post" : "Ireki aipatutako mezua",
    "Choose a reaction" : "Aukeratu erreakzio bat",
    "Choose an emoji" : "Aukeratu emoji bat",
    "Show me how my week went" : "Erakutsi nola joan den nire astea",
    "A line at the top of your feed, once a week, saying how many times you posted. Nobody else sees it, and there is no streak to keep up." : "Lerro bat zure jarioaren goialdean, astean behin, zenbat aldiz argitaratu duzun esanez. Beste inork ez du ikusten, eta ez dago mantendu beharreko segidarik.",
    "Could not change who can reply" : "Ezin izan da aldatu nork erantzun dezakeen",
    "This decides what happens from now on. Replies already posted stay. You can always reply yourself." : "Honek hemendik aurrera gertatzen dena erabakitzen du. Dagoeneko argitaratutako erantzunak geratu egiten dira. Zuk beti erantzun dezakezu.",
    "Could not load your scheduled posts" : "Ezin izan dira zure programatutako mezuak kargatu",
    "Moved to {date}" : "{date}-ra mugituta",
