    "Could not save the collection" : "Ezin izan da bilduma gorde",
    "Collection deleted" : "Bilduma ezabatu da",
    "Could not delete the collection" : "Ezin izan da bilduma ezabatu",
    "Could not remove the post from the collection" : "Ezin izan da mezua bildumatik kendu",
    "All collections" : "Bilduma guztiak",
    "Followers only" : "Jarraitzaileentzat soilik",
    "Remove posts" : "Kendu mezuak",
    "Remove from the collection" : "Kendu bildumatik",
    "Nothing in this collection yet" : "Ezer ez bilduma honetan oraindik",
    "Add posts to it from their menu: … → Add to a collection." : "Gehitu mezuak haien menutik: … → Gehitu bilduma batera.",
    "Edit collection" : "Editatu bilduma",
    "Description" : "Deskribapena",
    "Delete this collection?" : "Bilduma hau ezabatu?",
    "The collection goes; the posts in it stay where they are." : "Bilduma desagertzen da; bertako mezuak dauden lekuan geratzen dira.",
