    "When your account is locked, people asking to follow you show up here." : "Zure kontua blokeatuta dagoenean, zu jarraitzeko eskatzen duen jendea hemen agertzen da.",
    "Change that in your account settings." : "Aldatu hori zure kontuaren ezarpenetan.",
    "Load more" : "Kargatu gehiago",
    "Your account is yours. Take a copy of it whenever you like, move it to another server, or bring one here from somewhere else — including the posts you wrote there, with their pictures." : "Zure kontua zurea da. Atera kopia bat nahi duzunean, eraman beste zerbitzari batera, edo ekarri bat hona beste nonbaitetik — bertan idatzi zenituen mezuak barne, beren irudiekin.",
    "Page not found" : "Ez da orria aurkitu",
    "There is nothing at this address. The link may be wrong, or what it pointed to has moved." : "Ez dago ezer helbide honetan. Esteka okerra izan daiteke, edo adierazten zuena lekuz aldatu da.",
    "Back to my feed" : "Itzuli nire jariora",
    "Read all of your data" : "Irakurri zure datu guztiak",
    "Act as you: post, upload and change anything of yours" : "Jardun zu bezala: argitaratu, igo eta aldatu zure edozer",
