    "Authorized" : "Baimenduta",
    "Paste this code into {appDisplayName} to finish signing in. It can be used once, and only by the application that asked for it." : "Itsatsi kode hau {appDisplayName}-n saio-hasiera amaitzeko. Behin erabil daiteke, eta eskatu duen aplikazioak bakarrik.",
