    "Before" : "Lehen",
    "Both windows are the same length, so the pair is worth reading. A post counts on the day it went out, together with everything it has collected since." : "Bi leihoek luzera bera dute, beraz bikotea irakurtzea merezi du. Mezu bat bidali zen egunean zenbatzen da, ordutik bildu duen guztiarekin batera.",
