    "When your posts do best" : "Noiz funtzionatzen duten hobekien zure mezuek",
    "Not enough posts at any one hour to say yet — it takes three in the same hour before this is more than luck." : "Oraindik ez dago nahikoa mezu ordu batean ezer esateko — ordu berean hiru behar dira hau zortea baino gehiago izateko.",
