    "Average engagement of a post carrying the tag. Tags used once are left out: one post that did well is a post that did well." : "Etiketa daraman mezu baten batez besteko interakzioa. Behin erabilitako etiketak kanpoan uzten dira: ondo joan zen mezu bat ondo joan zen mezu bat da.",
