    "Where the engagement comes from" : "Nondik datorren elkarreragina",
    "Likes, boosts and replies, by the server of whoever made them. {n}% came from accounts on this server." : "Gogokoak, bultzadak eta erantzunak, egin dituenaren zerbitzariaren arabera. %{n} zerbitzari honetako kontuetatik etorri da.",
    "The network you are posting into" : "Argitaratzen duzun sarea",
