    "What the fediverse runs on" : "Fediverse zertan dabilen",
    "How the fediverse has grown" : "Nola hazi den Fediverse",
    "Accounts, month by month" : "Kontuak, hilabetez hilabete",
    "A step in this line is usually the survey reaching servers it had not reached before, rather than the network changing size — so no year-on-year figure is shown for a year that has one in it." : "Lerro honetako jauzi bat normalean inkesta lehen iristen ez zen zerbitzarietara iristea da, ez sarearen tamaina aldatzea — beraz ez da urtez urteko zifrarik erakusten halako bat duen urte baterako.",
    "What you did" : "Zer egin zenuen",
    "Everything above counts what came back to you. This counts what you did: a quiet month here is a month you did not post, not a month nobody answered." : "Goiko guztiak zuregana itzuli dena zenbatzen du. Honek zuk egin duzuna zenbatzen du: hemen hilabete lasai bat argitaratu ez zenuen hilabete bat da, ez inork erantzun ez zuen hilabete bat.",
    "How steadily you post" : "Zein etengabe argitaratzen duzun",
