    "longest quiet spell" : "isiltasun-aldi luzeena",
    "Who you talk with" : "Norekin hitz egiten duzun",
    "From the replies rather than from who you follow. The two are rarely the same list." : "Erantzunetatik, ez nor jarraitzen duzunetik. Biak gutxitan dira zerrenda bera.",
    "not followed" : "jarraitu gabeak",
    "{n}% of the people who replied to you are people you do not follow." : "Erantzun dizuten pertsonen % {n} zuk jarraitzen ez dituzunak dira.",
    "Your pictures" : "Zure irudiak",
    "carry a description" : "deskribapena dute",
    "{done} of {all}" : "{done} / {all}",
    "A picture without a description is a picture nobody using a screen reader can read. This is the one number on the page you can move on your own." : "Deskribapenik gabeko irudi bat pantaila-irakurgailua erabiltzen duen inork irakur ezin duen irudi bat da. Hau da orriko zuk zeuk mugi dezakezun zenbaki bakarra.",
