    "These figures are for the fediverse only. {networks} publishes no count of its accounts that could be quoted here, so it is not included." : "Zifra hauek fedibertsorako soilik dira. {networks} sareak ez du hemen aipa daitekeen bere kontuen zenbaketarik argitaratzen, beraz ez dago barne.",
    "Translated by {provider}" : "{provider}-k itzulia",
    "One step is left, on your old server: tell it to move your followers here. On Mastodon that is Preferences → Account → Move to a different account; enter {handle} there." : "Urrats bat geratzen da, zure zerbitzari zaharrean: esan zure jarraitzaileak hona eramateko. Mastodon-en Hobespenak → Kontua → Eraman beste kontu batera da; sartu {handle} bertan.",
    "The latest change was made on {date}. Until {until}, it can still be undone by: {keys}." : "Azken aldaketa {date} egunean egin zen. {until} arte, oraindik hauek desegin dezakete: {keys}.",
    "Visible for all" : "Denontzako ikusgai",
    "Visible for all, but opted-out of discovery features" : "Denontzako ikusgai, baina aurkikuntza-eginbideetatik kanpo",
